        <mxCell id="32w7eFk02iPKh0ns4fzg-2" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(240, 246, 252); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;Servers directory contains code &amp;amp; configs needed to run all services&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Я не змінював hosts файл, я просто заходив на 127.0.0.1:порт&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="10" y="1200" width="570" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="32w7eFk02iPKh0ns4fzg-3" value="Спочатку робимо всьо по рідмі, а далі потім якщо треба будемо розбиратись як воно працює&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1280" width="360" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="32w7eFk02iPKh0ns4fzg-4" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(240, 246, 252); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;EVALUATION:&lt;br&gt;1 - provide an LLM API key as &quot;environment LLM config&quot;.&lt;br&gt;2 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(240, 246, 252); background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces; background-color: rgba(101, 108, 118, 0.2); border-radius: 6px; color: rgb(240, 246, 252);&quot;&gt;/utils/eval.py&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(240, 246, 252); background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;, contains the decryption code, and you need to pass the decryption key as an environment variable when you run it:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces; background-color: rgba(101, 108, 118, 0.2); border-radius: 6px; color: rgb(240, 246, 252);&quot;&gt;DECRYPTION_KEY=&#39;theagentcompany is all you need&#39;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(240, 246, 252); background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;3.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(240, 246, 252); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;If you&#39;d like to use&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23); color: rgb(68, 147, 248); text-underline-offset: 0.2rem; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start;&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/All-Hands-AI/OpenHands&quot;&gt;OpenHands&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(240, 246, 252); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;for evaluation, please refer to the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23); color: rgb(68, 147, 248); text-underline-offset: 0.2rem; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start;&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/TheAgentCompany/TheAgentCompany/blob/main/evaluation/README.md&quot;&gt;RUN EVALUATION WITH OPENHANDS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(240, 246, 252); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;doc. You could also use it as a reference to automate your evaluation pipeline.&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="1300" width="410" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="32w7eFk02iPKh0ns4fzg-5" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(240, 246, 252); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(240, 246, 252); background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Start the container manually by running:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; background-color: rgb(21, 27, 35); color: rgb(240, 246, 252); position: relative !important; overflow: auto !important;&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; class=&quot;highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto&quot;&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; overflow-wrap: normal; padding: 16px; overflow: auto; line-height: 1.45; border-radius: 6px; word-break: normal; min-height: 52px;&quot;&gt;docker run --name &lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 123, 114);&quot; class=&quot;pl-k&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;container_name&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 123, 114);&quot; class=&quot;pl-k&quot;&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; --network host -it &lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 123, 114);&quot; class=&quot;pl-k&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;image_name&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 123, 114);&quot; class=&quot;pl-k&quot;&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; /bin/bash&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Note that this flag is only available on Linux. If you are using Macbook or Windows, and your servers are running on&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces; background-color: rgba(101, 108, 118, 0.2); border-radius: 6px; color: rgb(240, 246, 252); text-align: start;&quot;&gt;localhost&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(240, 246, 252); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;, you need to ensure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces; background-color: rgba(101, 108, 118, 0.2); border-radius: 6px; color: rgb(240, 246, 252); text-align: start;&quot;&gt;Settings &amp;gt; Resources &amp;gt; Network &amp;gt; Enable host networking&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(240, 246, 252); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;is enabled on your Docker Desktop.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; background-color: rgb(21, 27, 35); color: rgb(240, 246, 252); position: relative !important; overflow: auto !important;&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; class=&quot;highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto&quot;&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; overflow-wrap: normal; padding: 16px; overflow: auto; line-height: 1.45; border-radius: 6px; word-break: normal; min-height: 52px;&quot;&gt;SERVER_HOSTNAME=&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 123, 114);&quot; class=&quot;pl-k&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;hostname, default value is localhost&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 123, 114);&quot; class=&quot;pl-k&quot;&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; \&lt;br/&gt;LITELLM_API_KEY=&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 123, 114);&quot; class=&quot;pl-k&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;environment_llm_api_key&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 123, 114);&quot; class=&quot;pl-k&quot;&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; \&lt;br/&gt;LITELLM_BASE_URL=&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 123, 114);&quot; class=&quot;pl-k&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;environment_llm_base_url&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 123, 114);&quot; class=&quot;pl-k&quot;&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; \&lt;br/&gt;LITELLM_MODEL=&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 123, 114);&quot; class=&quot;pl-k&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;environment_llm_model_name&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 123, 114);&quot; class=&quot;pl-k&quot;&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; \&lt;br/&gt;bash /utils/init.sh&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; animation: auto ease 0s 1 normal none running none;&quot; class=&quot;zeroclipboard-container&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;octicon octicon-copy js-clipboard-copy-icon&quot; data-view-component=&quot;true&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M0 6.75C0 5.784.784 5 1.75 5h1.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-1.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v7.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h7.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-1.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0v1.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 9.25 16h-7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 14.25Z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M5 1.75C5 .784 5.784 0 6.75 0h7.5C15.216 0 16 .784 16 1.75v7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 14.25 11h-7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 5 9.25Zm1.75-.25a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v7.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h7.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-7.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25Z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(240, 246, 252); background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This might take up to 10 minutes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-60" y="1520" width="620" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="32w7eFk02iPKh0ns4fzg-6" value="де цей evaluation container, а де task container&lt;br&gt;Де Цей base_&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;image та tasks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; overflow-wrap: normal; padding: 16px; overflow: auto; line-height: 1.45; color: rgb(240, 246, 252); background-color: rgb(21, 27, 35); border-radius: 6px; text-align: start;&quot; class=&quot;notranslate&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background: transparent; border-radius: 6px; word-break: normal; border: 0px; display: inline; overflow: visible; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: normal;&quot;&gt;base_image/&lt;br&gt;│   ├── Dockerfile&lt;br&gt;│   ├── init.sh&lt;br&gt;│   ├── eval.py&lt;br&gt;│   └── ...&lt;br&gt;├── tasks/&lt;br&gt;│   └── admin-arrange-meeting-rooms-image/&lt;br&gt;│       ├── Dockerfile&lt;br&gt;│       ├── evaluator.py&lt;br&gt;│       ├── checkpoints.md&lt;br&gt;│       ├── dependencies.yml&lt;br&gt;│       ├── task.md&lt;br&gt;|   └── ...&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
